    "steam_appid": 1692520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692520/extras/dfd69a282d099c606fe4043aacb7efa6.avif?t=1672340704\" /></div><br><u>Robots n Lasers </u><br>is a fast paced shooter game, in which you have to fight yourself through dark corridors and starlit floating platforms. Fight against different enemy types designed to adapt your playstyle according to which enemy compositions you currently are facing.<br><br>The game comes with 4 Levels each with 3 different variants. So there is a normal Level and for each Level there are two Challenge Levels.<br><br>- 6 Enemy types<br>- 3 Weapons<br>- 4 Abilities<br>- Different methods of upgrading your character<br>- Dynamic difficulty",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1692520/extras/dfd69a282d099c606fe4043aacb7efa6.avif?t=1672340704\" /></div><br><u>Robots n Lasers </u><br>is a fast paced shooter game, in which you have to fight yourself through dark corridors and starlit floating platforms. Fight against different enemy types designed to adapt your playstyle according to which enemy compositions you currently are facing.<br><br>The game comes with 4 Levels each with 3 different variants. So there is a normal Level and for each Level there are two Challenge Levels.<br><br>- 6 Enemy types<br>- 3 Weapons<br>- 4 Abilities<br>- Different methods of upgrading your character<br>- Dynamic difficulty",
    "short_description": "Robots n Lasers is my first Project to be published. It is a shooter based on fast reactions, aim and a little bit of patience.",
